            "content": "专题 5 冲激响应与阶跃响应"
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph_title",
            "bbox": [
                0.185,
                0.141,
                0.422,
                0.159
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "考点1: 冲激响应的求解"
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph_title",
            "bbox": [
                0.185,
                0.169,
                0.256,
                0.185
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "1、定义"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.184,
                0.194,
                0.813,
                0.235
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "以单位冲激信号 \\( \\delta(t) \\) 作激励，系统产生的零状态响应称为“单位冲激响应”或简称“冲激响应”，以 \\( h(t) \\) 表示。",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.185,
                0.243,
                0.578,
                0.259
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "例 27: 已知某一LTI系统对激励 \\( e(t) \\) 的零状态响应",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "equation",
            "bbox": [
                0.384,
                0.265,
                0.609,
                0.303
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "\\[\nr _ {z s} (t) = \\int_ {t - 2} ^ {\\infty} e ^ {t - \\tau} e (\\tau - 1) d \\tau\n\\]"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.186,
                0.307,
                0.398,
                0.323
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "求该系统的单位冲激响应。",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.185,
                0.51,
                0.49,
                0.525
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "2、经典法求解——微分方程表示系统",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.184,
                0.71,
                0.812,
                0.752
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "例 28: 若激励为 \\(e(t)\\), 响应 \\(r(t)\\) 的系统的微分方程由下式描述, 求系统的冲激响应 \\(h(t)\\)。",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "equation",
            "bbox": [
                0.41,
                0.758,
                0.586,
                0.791
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "\\[\n\\frac {d r (t)}{d t} + 2 r (t) = 3 e (t)\n\\]"
        },
