            "content": "考点 3: 阶跃响应的求解"
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph_title",
            "bbox": [
                0.186,
                0.139,
                0.257,
                0.154
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "1、定义"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.185,
                0.163,
                0.812,
                0.204
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "以单位阶跃信号 \\( u(t) \\) 作激励，系统产生的零状态响应称为“单位阶跃响应”或简称“阶跃响应”，以 \\( g(t) \\) 表示。",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.185,
                0.279,
                0.4,
                0.295
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "2、阶跃响应的经典法求解",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.185,
                0.481,
                0.475,
                0.497
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "例 31: 描述某LTI系统的微分方程为",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "equation",
            "bbox": [
                0.33,
                0.504,
                0.666,
                0.539
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "\\[\n\\frac {d ^ {2} r (t)}{d t ^ {2}} + 5 \\frac {d r (t)}{d t} + 6 r (t) = 3 \\frac {d e (t)}{d t} + 2 e (t)\n\\]"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.186,
                0.545,
                0.359,
                0.56
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "试求其阶跃响应 \\( g(t) \\) 。",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
