        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.634,
                0.056,
                0.837,
                0.072
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "公众号：通信考研小马哥",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.183,
                0.11,
                0.812,
                0.151
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "例 32: 若激励为 \\(e(t)\\), 响应 \\(r(t)\\) 的 LTI 系统的微分方程由下式描述, 求系统的阶跃响应 \\(g(t)\\)。",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "equation",
            "bbox": [
                0.336,
                0.158,
                0.659,
                0.193
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "\\[\n\\frac {d r (t)}{d t} + 2 r (t) = \\frac {d ^ {2} e (t)}{d t ^ {2}} + 3 \\frac {d e (t)}{d t} + 3 e (t)\n\\]"
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph_title",
            "bbox": [
                0.185,
                0.464,
                0.383,
                0.48
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "3、LTIS下微积分求解法"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.186,
                0.489,
                0.595,
                0.504
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "由于单位阶跃函数 \\( u(t) \\) 与单位冲激函数 \\( \\delta(t) \\) 的关系为",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "equation",
            "bbox": [
                0.36,
                0.512,
                0.638,
                0.547
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "\\[\n\\delta (t) = \\frac {d u (t)}{d t}, u (t) = \\int_ {- \\infty} ^ {t} \\delta (x) d x\n\\]"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.185,
                0.554,
                0.752,
                0.57
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "根据LTI系统的微(积)分特性,同一系统的阶跃响应与冲激响应的关系为",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "equation",
            "bbox": [
                0.359,
                0.578,
                0.638,
                0.612
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "\\[\nh (t) = \\frac {d g (t)}{d t}, g (t) = \\int_ {- \\infty} ^ {t} h (x) d x\n\\]"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.185,
                0.641,
                0.501,
                0.658
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "例：若已知 \\( h(t)=(-4e^{-2t}+7e^{-3t})u(t) \\)",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "equation",
            "bbox": [
                0.233,
                0.666,
                0.767,
                0.786
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "\\[\n\\begin{array}{c} \\therefore g (t) = \\int_ {- \\infty} ^ {t} h (\\tau) d \\tau = \\int_ {- \\infty} ^ {t} [ - 4 e ^ {- 2 \\tau} + 7 e ^ {- 3 \\tau} ] u (\\tau) d \\tau \\\\ = \\left[ - 4 \\int_ {0} ^ {t} e ^ {- 2 \\tau} d \\tau + 7 \\int_ {0} ^ {t} e ^ {- 3 \\tau} d \\tau \\right] u (t) = \\left[ - 4 \\cdot \\frac {e ^ {- 2 \\tau}}{- 2} \\Bigg | _ {0} ^ {t} + 7 \\cdot \\frac {e ^ {- 3 \\tau}}{- 3} \\Bigg | _ {0} ^ {t} \\right] u (t) \\\\ = \\left[ 2 (e ^ {- 2 t} - 1) - \\frac {7}{3} (e ^ {- 3 t} - 1) \\right] u (t) = \\left(2 e ^ {- 2 t} - \\frac {7}{3} e ^ {- 3 t} + \\frac {1}{3}\\right) u (t) \\end{array}\n\\]"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.159,
                0.882,
                0.373,
                0.899
            ],
